---
title: "governance::execute_governance_instruction (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: latest_only = state::assert_latest_only(pyth_state)
    q_version --> q_seq: sequence = receipt.sequence
    q_seq --> q_check_seq: sequence > last_executed_governance_sequence
    q_check_seq --> q_abort_seq: false, abort E_CANNOT_EXECUTE_WITH_OBSOLETE_SEQUENCE
    q_check_seq --> q_update_seq: true
    q_update_seq --> q_parse: set_last_executed_governance_sequence(latest_only, pyth_state, sequence)
    q_parse --> q_dispatch: instruction = governance_instruction::from_byte_vec(payload)
    q_dispatch --> q_contract_upgrade: action == contract_upgrade
    q_dispatch --> q_set_gov_src: action == set_governance_data_source
    q_dispatch --> q_set_data_src: action == set_data_sources
    q_dispatch --> q_set_fee: action == set_update_fee
    q_dispatch --> q_set_stale: action == set_stale_price_threshold
    q_dispatch --> q_set_recipient: action == set_fee_recipient
    q_dispatch --> q_invalid: unknown action
    q_contract_upgrade --> q_abort_upgrade: abort E_MUST_USE_CONTRACT_UPGRADE_MODULE
    q_set_gov_src --> [*]: set_governance_data_source::execute(...)
    q_set_data_src --> [*]: set_data_sources::execute(...)
    q_set_fee --> [*]: set_update_fee::execute(...)
    q_set_stale --> [*]: set_stale_price_threshold::execute(...)
    q_set_recipient --> [*]: set_fee_recipient::execute(...)
    q_invalid --> q_abort_invalid: abort E_INVALID_GOVERNANCE_ACTION

    note right of q_check_seq
        INV-001: sequence must be strictly greater than last executed (replay protection)
        INV-002: contract upgrades must use the contract_upgrade module directly
        INV-003: sequence is updated BEFORE dispatching action
        INV-004: governance instruction must target this chain or chain 0 (all chains)
    end note
